{"code":"000760","name":"이화산업","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1950년 염료 제조 및 판매 등을 목적으로 설립되었으며, 1982년 화학중간체를 제조하는 유정화학(주)를 흡수합병하였음. 1994년 유가증권시장에 상장하였으며, 주요 종속회사로 부동산 임대 전문업체인 영화기업(주)와 이화물산(주)를 보유하고 있음. 국내외 상품 도소매가 주요사업으로, 염료사업부문과 식품첨가물·공업용첨가물·용제류 등 화학품을 판매하는 유통사업부문, 부동산 임대사업부문으로 구성되어 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":12140.0,"open":12060.0,"high":12300.0,"low":12000.0,"volume":1089,"amount":13220460.0,"ret_1d":0.8306,"gap":0.1661,"range_pct":2.4712,"ret_5":-1.8593,"ret_20":1.251,"ret_60":-11.3869,"ret_120":-24.125,"ret_250":-1.3008,"ma20":12163.5,"ma60":12928.1667,"ma120":12974.3333,"ma200":13985.0,"close_vs_ma200":-13.1927,"close_vs_ma60":-6.0965,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-42.4304,"r2_60":0.3696,"slope_120":-20.3469,"r2_120":0.1254,"slope_250":-16.7015,"r2_250":0.1693,"high52":25250.0,"low52":10380.0,"pos_52w":11.8359,"dd_52w":-51.9208,"mdd_1y":-47.1744,"atr14_pct":5.6837,"vol_ann_60":40.9799,"vol_avg20":1118.1,"vol_ratio20":0.974,"vr5":1.144,"vr20":0.6911,"amount_avg5":15112474.0,"amount_avg20":13665224.0,"amount_avg60":14621637.8333,"obv_chg20":44.0658,"turnover_20":0.7986,"pv_eff_20":1.5665,"rsi14":46.7193,"frgn_net_5":138.0,"inst_net_5":-13.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0049,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0005,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0045,"frgn_net_20":1171.0,"inst_net_20":130.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0418,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0046,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0465,"frgn_net_60":156.0,"inst_net_60":438.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0056,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0156,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0212,"frgn_net_120":-3005.0,"inst_net_120":277.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1073,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0099,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0974,"foreign_ratio":0.34,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":11.0,"op_margin_q":8.209,"op_qoq":37.5,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":22.2222,"rev_yoy":7.2,"op_trend_4q":76.5714,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-0.87,"debt_ratio":31.31,"per":null,"pbr":0.25,"div